{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 588908, "game_id": 1164, "entry_id": 119658, "uid": 154257, "type": 4, "title": "PVE角色强度自助评估", "tag": "2", "created_at": 1681815466, "updated_at": 1685127864, "updated_uid": 154257, "comment_at": 1681979379, "last_at": 1688634246, "comment_count": 2, "status": 1, "summary": "本工具用于解决【抽不抽/练不练/用不用】的问题，使玩家可在无助时自主判断。广义上的角色强度可分为先天（设计）和后天（实用）两层，先天强度是单纯考虑本身技能组的整体强度，只随着点火和加值的提升而增加；后", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1097/h_1947/1164/154257/2023/4/27/876795.jpg", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 11, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 5332, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 1, "last_ip_area": "吉林省", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 2, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 588908, "content": "<span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">本工具用于解决【抽不抽/练不练/用不用】的问题，使玩家可在无助时自主判断。</span><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">广义上的角色强度可分为先天（设计）和后天（实用）两层，先天强度是单纯考虑本身技能组的整体强度，只随着点火和加值的提升而增加；后天强度要结合玩家的实际配置，包括角色以外的练度，变数因人而异。攻略和节奏榜在编写过程中主要讨论的是先天练度，可能会提及后天练度，例如【符合xx条件的玩家优先xx】，但不可能面面俱到，更多时候还要靠玩家自己灵活掌握。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">我之前写过一期PVE入门，其中包括了基本上所有的常见技能，站内也有增减益的专门整理，游戏内也自带筛选器，本工具在此基础上进一步解读主要技能的用法和价值，起到一个类似于技能节奏榜的作用，并尽可能同时覆盖到先天和后天强度。掌握了每个技能的价值和用法之后，就能模糊地评估出一个角色的强度和可用性。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"1097\" data-height=\"1947\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1097/h_1947/1164/154257/2023/4/27/876795.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1097/h_1947/1164/154257/2023/4/27/876795.jpg\"></div><br></div></div><br></div></div></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-color=\"#666666\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"><em></em><em></em></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">用法示例</div>\n                                    <div class=\"fold-color-wrapper\">\n                                      <label>折叠颜色：</label>\n                                      <div class=\"fold-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\"></div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><div class=\"div-img\">以暗犹大<img data-width=\"250\" data-height=\"250\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_250/h_250/1164/154257/2023/3/20/195023.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_250/h_250/1164/154257/2023/3/20/195023.png\" style=\"width: 50px; height: 50px;\">为例，首先观察其U数据：</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\">NS：</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\">1体2回合应援</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\">智能三体翻面（<span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">5人巨大BOSS战限定</span>）</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\">SS：</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\">3体2回合技伤②+125%</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\">1体2回合DS充能量+64.3%（5人巨大BOSS战限定）</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\">DS：</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\">1体3回合技伤①+120%</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\">暗属性全体20秒DS<span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">充能量+45%（5人巨大BOSS战限定）</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\">首先判断先天技能价值，两个技伤都是高新面板，应援一般但有就比没有强，三个加速都是锦上添花，六个技能全部有效，5人本价值超高。另外两个技伤不限定5人本，WB价值超高，整体价值极高。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">其次判断后天价值，仅技伤①为可能价值波动较大的有责任技能，如果自己用的还不是百分比刀，那么价值<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">暂时</span>下降一些，但其余技能整体价值仍较高。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">最后判断投资需求，观察未点火数据，主要是机制变化，数值变化基本都有：</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\">应援未回合化</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\">翻面仅2体</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\">技伤②未回合化</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\">DS充能量未回合化</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\">技伤②仅2回合</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">应援是几率技能，点火比较安定，<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">再加上翻面受益，因此NS</span>尽量点火。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">SS点火主要是回合化的受益，影响到技能设置和攻击力顺位，点火后更自由，不点可能导致其他未点火角色不能打N，且被控时容易断BUFF。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">DS不点火可能无法常驻效果，并产生DS设置限制。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">NS和DS都无条件影响输出，分别对应5火和4火，因此取其中较高者，即至少点5火。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">因为第6火只要1石头+1狗粮，但能换来解放SNN、解放其他角色打SN、不怕被控，虽然暂时也许用不到，但迟早用到时能节省很多脑细胞，性价比极高，最终判定应直接满火。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">加值至少有增伤技能的实打实需求，所以也要抽/还魂。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">综合结论：马上满火，在条件允许的范围内尽量突破，最终目标U。</div></div>\n                               </div><br></div></span></div>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": ["//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1097/h_1947/1164/154257/2023/4/27/876795.jpg"], "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 154257, "username": "时崎狂肝", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/7.png", "description": "人生就像一场电影，总要有人演写攻略的。", "follow_num": 46, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 2, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 1, "content_at": 227688, "content_num": 55, "read_num": 253212, "like_num": 426}, "update_user": {"uid": 154257, "username": "时崎狂肝", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/7.png", "description": "人生就像一场电影，总要有人演写攻略的。", "follow_num": 46, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 0, "is_super": false, "statu